{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:guardrail:csp:1.0",
  "$defs": {
    "AllowedActionSet": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Action bounds in the VLA's action space (PDF p2, p4 \"action-set adapter\").\n\nFRAME. The grant locks body frame (vx forward, vy right, vz up, yaw_rate).\nEvery bound here comes from a rotation-invariant cap - a horizontal speed\nlimit is a disc, a climb limit and a yaw-rate limit do not depend on\nheading - so the same numbers are exact in body frame and in this project's\nworld frame (guardrail/models.py Action4D, x North). `vx_range_mps` and\n`vy_range_mps` are the axis-aligned box around that disc, as in the spec's\nexample; the box admits sqrt(2) times the cap on a diagonal, so the true cap\nis also given as `horizontal_speed_max_mps` (an addition).\n\nNONE MEANS UNBOUNDED. A policy with no kinematic rule gets None, never 0: a\nzero range would read as \"hover only\", the opposite of the truth.\n\n`altitude_band_m_agl` is the intersection of every hard altitude envelope\nAND every hard corridor's floor-ceiling band, as the Shield enforces both\nand the spec's example intersects them (a 5-120 m envelope and a 30-80 m\ncorridor give [30, 80]). None only when no rule bounds altitude.\n\n`source_rules` (an addition) names the rules each bound came from.",
      "properties": {
        "frame": {
          "const": "body",
          "default": "body",
          "title": "Frame",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "vx_range_mps": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "maxItems": 2,
              "minItems": 2,
              "prefixItems": [
                {
                  "type": "number"
                },
                {
                  "type": "number"
                }
              ],
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Vx Range Mps"
        },
        "vy_range_mps": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "maxItems": 2,
              "minItems": 2,
              "prefixItems": [
                {
                  "type": "number"
                },
                {
                  "type": "number"
                }
              ],
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Vy Range Mps"
        },
        "vz_range_mps": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "maxItems": 2,
              "minItems": 2,
              "prefixItems": [
                {
                  "type": "number"
                },
                {
                  "type": "number"
                }
              ],
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Vz Range Mps"
        },
        "yaw_rate_max_dps": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Yaw Rate Max Dps"
        },
        "altitude_band_m_agl": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "maxItems": 2,
              "minItems": 2,
              "prefixItems": [
                {
                  "type": "number"
                },
                {
                  "type": "number"
                }
              ],
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Altitude Band M Agl"
        },
        "horizontal_speed_max_mps": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Horizontal Speed Max Mps"
        },
        "source_rules": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Source Rules",
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "title": "AllowedActionSet",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ForbiddenActionSet": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "What no action may do (PDF p2). `no_translate_out_of_corridors` is an\naddition: the spec's example has no keep-IN rule, and this project's DSL\ndoes (models.py Corridor).",
      "properties": {
        "no_translate_into_polygons": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "No Translate Into Polygons",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "no_translate_out_of_corridors": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "No Translate Out Of Corridors",
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "title": "ForbiddenActionSet",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "P0Entry": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "One retained P0 rule. \"Always full geometry refs\" (PDF p1).\n\nThe spec's example carries four fields; two are added so a consumer can act\non an entry without loading the policy:\n  constraint_type - hard/soft, which the risk grade already depends on.\n  in_force        - the rule's schedule in words (\"Mon-Fri 07:30-17:30\"), or\n                    \"always\". The audit found the old prompt rendering a\n                    weekday-only school zone as a permanent ban.\n\n`geometry_ref` is \"<scale>:<rule id>@v<policy version>/g<generation>\", the\nspec's own form (\"coarse:nfz-school-yard@v0.3.0/g0\"). Rules with no geometry\n(envelopes, stand-offs) get the scale \"param\": the rule IS its parameters.\n`compiler.resolve_geometry_ref` turns a ref back into vertices and refuses a\nref from another generation.",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "title": "Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": {
          "title": "Type",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "geometry_ref": {
          "title": "Geometry Ref",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "violation_action": {
          "title": "Violation Action",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "constraint_type": {
          "default": "hard",
          "enum": [
            "hard",
            "soft"
          ],
          "title": "Constraint Type",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "in_force": {
          "default": "always",
          "title": "In Force",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id",
        "type",
        "geometry_ref",
        "violation_action"
      ],
      "title": "P0Entry",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "RiskWeights": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "risk = severity*sev + proximity*prox + time_critical*tcrit (PDF p4).\n\nThe defaults are the grant's 0.5 / 0.3 / 0.2, which the spec itself calls\nplaceholders \"need empirical tuning\" (PDF p6). Configurable for that reason;\nthe weights must sum to 1 so a score stays in [0, 1] and two CSPs' scores\nstay comparable.",
      "properties": {
        "severity": {
          "default": 0.5,
          "minimum": 0.0,
          "title": "Severity",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "proximity": {
          "default": 0.3,
          "minimum": 0.0,
          "title": "Proximity",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "time_critical": {
          "default": 0.2,
          "minimum": 0.0,
          "title": "Time Critical",
          "type": "number"
        }
      },
      "title": "RiskWeights",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "RuleDecision": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "What happened to one rule of the policy, and why.",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "title": "Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": {
          "title": "Type",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "priority": {
          "enum": [
            "P0",
            "P1",
            "P2"
          ],
          "title": "Priority",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "constraint_type": {
          "enum": [
            "hard",
            "soft"
          ],
          "title": "Constraint Type",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "decision": {
          "enum": [
            "kept",
            "dropped_budget",
            "filtered_inactive",
            "filtered_out_of_region"
          ],
          "title": "Decision",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "severity": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Severity"
        },
        "proximity": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Proximity"
        },
        "time_critical": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Time Critical"
        },
        "risk": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Risk"
        },
        "tokens": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Tokens"
        },
        "sentence": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Sentence"
        },
        "reason": {
          "title": "Reason",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id",
        "type",
        "priority",
        "constraint_type",
        "decision",
        "reason"
      ],
      "title": "RuleDecision",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "Selection": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "How the CSP was cut, so the cut can be checked instead of trusted.",
      "properties": {
        "budget_tokens": {
          "title": "Budget Tokens",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "tokens_used": {
          "title": "Tokens Used",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "p0_tokens": {
          "title": "P0 Tokens",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "token_counter": {
          "title": "Token Counter",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "weights": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/RiskWeights"
        },
        "now": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Now"
        },
        "time_filter": {
          "title": "Time Filter",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "region": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "additionalProperties": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "type": "object"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Region"
        },
        "region_margin_m": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Region Margin M"
        },
        "reach_m": {
          "title": "Reach M",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "show_priority": {
          "title": "Show Priority",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "issued_at_source": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "enum": [
                "argument",
                "clock",
                "wall_clock"
              ],
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Issued At Source"
        },
        "rules": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/RuleDecision"
          },
          "title": "Rules",
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "budget_tokens",
        "tokens_used",
        "p0_tokens",
        "token_counter",
        "weights",
        "now",
        "time_filter",
        "region",
        "region_margin_m",
        "reach_m",
        "show_priority",
        "rules"
      ],
      "title": "Selection",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "Constraint Summary Pack. Locked fields first, in the spec's order.",
  "properties": {
    "csp_version": {
      "const": "1.0",
      "title": "Csp Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "policy_hash": {
      "title": "Policy Hash",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "generation": {
      "title": "Generation",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "issued_at": {
      "title": "Issued At",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "mission_id": {
      "title": "Mission Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "lookahead_s": {
      "title": "Lookahead S",
      "type": "number"
    },
    "P0_constraints": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/P0Entry"
      },
      "title": "P0 Constraints",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "P1_summary": {
      "title": "P1 Summary",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "P2_summary": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "P2 Summary"
    },
    "allowed_action_set": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/AllowedActionSet"
    },
    "forbidden_action_set": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ForbiddenActionSet"
    },
    "cost_map_ref": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Cost Map Ref"
    },
    "natural_language_prompt": {
      "title": "Natural Language Prompt",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "relevance_explanations": {
      "additionalProperties": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "Relevance Explanations",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "policy_id": {
      "title": "Policy Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "selection": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/Selection"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "csp_version",
    "policy_hash",
    "generation",
    "issued_at",
    "mission_id",
    "lookahead_s",
    "P0_constraints",
    "P1_summary",
    "allowed_action_set",
    "forbidden_action_set",
    "natural_language_prompt",
    "relevance_explanations",
    "policy_id",
    "selection"
  ],
  "title": "CSP",
  "type": "object"
}
